  "title": "4D rotation exponential, logarithm and geodesics",
  "purpose": "Turn plane rates into a rotation with a closed-form matrix exponential, recover the two invariant plane angles and the generator of any 4D rotation, classify it (simple, isoclinic, double), interpolate along SO(4) geodesics, and write a looping rotation glTF.",
